  "title": "A TANNAKIAN DESCRIPTION OF THE LOCAL KALETHA GERBE",
  "authors_raw": "ALEXANDER BERTOLONI MELI AND PETER DILLERY",
  "title_lines": [
   "A TANNAKIAN DESCRIPTION OF THE LOCAL KALETHA GERBE"
  ],
  "abstract": "We construct, for ap-adic fieldF, an explicit semisimple Tannakian categoryRigIsoc F whose category of fiber functors recovers Kaletha\u2019s Galois gerbeE Kal. We then classify and write down the simple objects inRigIsoc F , all of which come from elliptic twisted Levi subgroups ofGLn.",
